WEBVTT

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.820
Where... am I?

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.820
Are you the one who was calling me?

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.080
Dammit... Not at a time like this!

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.460
That's right.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.720
That was the day when I...

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.560
You...!

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.660
Don't call me that.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.680
Avrora Florestina.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.040
That is our name.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:18.800
Avrora...?

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.240
Nine months ago, on my way back from visiting Nagisa in the hospital...

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.160
I met her.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.880
The Twelfth Kaleid Blood.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:30.820
Avrora.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:37.620
Kojou!

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.980
And then <i>that</i> happened.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:47.800
The event that caused me to awaken as the Fourth Primogenitor, and lose Avrora.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.560
The Scorched Banquet.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.420
Senpai! Get a hold of yourself!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.420
Senpai!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.880
What the hell is going on!?

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.460
It's fast! A therianthrope?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:42.840
It got ahead of us!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:43.780
Run!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.800
You've got to be kidding me!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.280
What... the heck is this!?

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.300
Mogwai, what's going on!?

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.780
It's exactly as it appears.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:02.360
Demons all over Itogami Island collapsed all of a sudden,

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.000
some monsters appeared, which are going wild after sucking their magical energy.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.720
Shit! How did this happen!?

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.080
Don't tell me...

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.820
The demon registration bracelets!?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:17.660
A time-delayed virus has been inserted into the elementary magic circuit used for monitoring.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:21.320
You mean when the Island Guard got hacked yesterday!?

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.060
They got us good.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.820
The criminals weren't after the servers at headquarters, it was this!

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.100
Can't you do something about it?

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:32.540
That would be difficult.

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.360
They've been cut off from the Island Guard network as well...

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.660
And I have no physical means to apply a vaccine!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.120
Not quite. You have a way, don't you, Missy?

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:48.140
A way to forcefully gain access to a demon registration bracelet that has been cut off from the network.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.300
Oh, I see! It's "C"!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:52.660
Get down!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.540
So that's why they're after you, Asagi!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.820
What do you mean?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.360
You're the only one who can stop this!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.380
Let's go to the Keystone Gate!

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.180
What!?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.240
If you want to complain, I'll listen to you later!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.900
We've got to hurry... or Itogami Island might not exist after today!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.540
Wait!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.740
Oh, give me a break!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:20.860
Senpai!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.500
What's with the pathetic voice, Himeragi?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.740
Senpai! Thank goodness.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.620
You were unconscious for close to an hour.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.620
One hour... only that long?

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.640
I had a really long dream.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:42.300
No... Avrora. That wasn't a dream, was it?

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.260
Senpai?

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.520
So you finally woke up, huh?

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.700
Mogwai!

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.460
You don't have the time to be lazing around.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.040
Take a look at the city.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.460
What the heck is this!?

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:00.820
Did Tartaros Lapus do this?

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:06.300
Yeah. They used a virus to hack into the demon registration bracelets and are gathering magical energy.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.520
Magical energy!? Why would they do that?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.020
Look above you.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:12.720
A rose?

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.040
No, that is a magic circle.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.440
It's so dense that I can scarcely believe it.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.720
So this is the true form of Tartaros' Rose.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:30.260
Asagi is currently on her way to the Keystone Gate to stop this.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.880
Can you keep Itogami Island from falling to pieces in the meanwhile, Mister?

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.780
Falling to pieces?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:37.820
Senpai!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.500
I won't let you do as you please!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.100
Come out, Regulus-Aurum!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.580
They resurrected!?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.360
The summoning magic from that Rose is still in effect!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.620
In that case... Come out! Al-Meissa Mercury!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.180
Thanks Himeragi! You saved me!

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.180
I only did my job as your Observer.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.480
But at this rate...!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.580
I know. The situation will only get worse.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.820
Dammit... What should I do!?

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.840
Der Freischutz!?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.440
A magical bullet multi-lock on! This technique is... Don't tell me!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.560
Kojou-kun! Yuki!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.660
Yuiri-san, Shio-san, and Kirasaka!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.540
Grenda, you came too!?

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:08.700
Da!

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:11.720
I see.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.140
So we just have to find the magician who is controlling that magic circle, right?

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.320
Can you do that?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.080
For a War Dancer, it's the most basic thing.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:21.500
Boundary!

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:30.020
Authenticate! Freikugel Plus Proto III, unlock!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.060
Rosenkavalier Plus! Boot up!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:40.020
Kojou-kun, leave this to us and get some rest.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.100
But...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:47.700
Senpai. I need to talk to you about something.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:52.540
What's wrong, Himeragi? Why did you bring me all the way here?

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.460
It's okay, Senpai.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.460
Umm...

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:02.780
Himeragi?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.640
I'm telling you that it's okay to suck my blood!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.300
Don't make me say it!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:12.640
Eh!? But why, all of a sudden!?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.420
December-san's ability...

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.600
It seals your power to control Familiars.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:27.760
If I'm not wrong, then increasing your vampiric power
will allow you to keep ownership of them.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.640
Or maybe...

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:33.540
You don't want it to be me?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.660
No, it's not that...

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:39.280
I can't do that in this sort of situation...

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.100
I understand.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.180
In that case, Senpai, close your eyes.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:46.680
Hmm? Sure...

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.940
Himeragi... Is this your...?

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.580
Don't worry about it!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:08.520
My handkerchief wasn't long enough.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:09.940
So it's not your handkerchief?

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.560
It smells kind of nice, though...

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.160
Smells like soap...

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.640
Stop smelling it!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.520
I don't need your comments!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.000
H-Himeragi...

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.280
How... is it?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.860
How should I say this...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.280
I want to keep doing this forever.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:40.020
No! It tickles!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.260
S-Senpai!?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.100
Not there...!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.440
Himeragi...

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.480
You musn't...! No!

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:18.420
No, Senpai! Don't stop!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.140
You need to drink more.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.620
I can't do that, Himeragi.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:23.940
Your body can't take any more of this.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:29.000
But you might not be able to beat December-san the way you are now.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.060
Himeragi...

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.380
Da?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.860
You can't, Grenda!

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.580
Yuiri-san?

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.120
It's not what you think, Yuki!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:41.200
Grenda was tired, so I wanted to let her rest...

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.020
I wasn't peeking or anything!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.360
K-Kojou-kun...?

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.220
Grenda!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:55.940
Senpai. This is an emergency, so I'll allow it, just this once.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.280
Just this once, you hear?

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.360
Yuki... what do mean, "allow"?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:04.580
Umm... Wait...

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:05.720
I'm not against it, but...

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.240
This is my first time...

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.680
Bear with it for a little while.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.360
No way!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.820
Yuki, don't look!

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:31.380
Koukarin!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:36.960
Kirasaka! How many shots do you have left?

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.360
Including my spares, six! How about you?

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.260
The same.

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:43.340
At this rate, we won't last more than three or four minutes!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.560
Hikawa Shio!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.380
Al-Nasl-Minium!

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:51.580
Are you okay?

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:55.260
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:56.840
Sayaka-san!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.080
Sorry we're late, Kirasaka-san!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:01.640
Haba Yuiri... and Yukina, too!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.840
Your faces are red, are you two okay?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.520
Wait...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.720
Akatsuki Kojou! Don't tell me, you did it again!?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.920
The Four Heavenly Beasts!?

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:22.220
The mythical beasts said to govern over the four cardinal directions of heaven...

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:24.900
The symbols of power in Feng Shui...

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.100
Don't tell me... He used the structure of Itogami Island itself,

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.740
which was built to correspond to the four gods!?

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:36.300
So this is what Tartaros Lapus were really after!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.340
I've found the magician!

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.060
Direction, three o'clock, distance 6200 meters!

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.180
6200? Wouldn't that be on top of the ocean?

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.520
Itogami Island's abandoned District 27.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.160
The former site of an early man-made island,

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.200
It was sunk only nine months ago.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.740
I see.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:02.380
If she's going to appear again one last time, that's the only place, huh?

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.900
Are you ready, Hikawa Shio?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.200
What about you?

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.140
We'll buy you some time. Make it count!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.840
Let's go, Senpai!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:12.500
Yeah!

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.160
Grenda, are you ready?

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:15.080
Da!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.940
Dammit, the Keystone Gate is right in front of our noses!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.560
There aren't any places left to hide and move anymore!

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:27.900
Need some help, Carly?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.960
It's fine. I have them cornered.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.880
It's all or nothing.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.420
I'll be the decoy.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.540
Run to the Keystone Gate as fast as you can!

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:39.540
But...!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:41.440
We don't have the time to hesitate!

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:44.560
Mogwai, I'll leave you to guide Asagi!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.380
Leave it to me!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.380
I'm starting the countdown.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:52.760
Three... Two... One... Zero!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.900
Oh no, you don't!

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.820
An Air Elemental!?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.720
No, a Wraith!?

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:08.460
Something like that... If I destroy the clone, even the
technique user should receive damage!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:10.120
And now...!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.540
I'm not done yet!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:23.320
Sorry... December...

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:27.340
I... In a place like this...

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.040
Dammit, I guess I tried too hard.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:43.220
The rest is in your hands, Kojou...

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.180
Carly! What's wrong, Carly!?

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:49.460
You're not going anywhere.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.060
Resistance is futile.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:02.100
Answer me.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.520
Where is Senga Takehito?

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.160
Program.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:22.220
Tartaros Rose's network infiltration dropped to 77%.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.340
Demon registration bracelets... Signal lost from 4800 units.

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.520
Even you can't stop her?

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.100
Aiba Asagi really is something else.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.100
Ran, that's enough. Run away.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.200
I can handle the rest on my own.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.300
I'm sorry, I can't run away.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:45.180
I don't... want to... go away.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.120
Ran...

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.000
Stop it, Ran!

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.420
She's a monster who has control over this entire man-made island!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:55.620
These are the memories of "C"... So pretty...

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.600
I...

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.740
Don't go, Ran!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:10.020
Sorry, Ran... I love you.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:13.240
Carly... Rogi... Everyone...

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:23.600
Ran's brain has been embedded with refined neurons,
sixteen times more than a normal person would have.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.200
Of course, such a thing is impossible for a live human being.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:33.760
So she was given a dead body, one that
moved using the power of necromancy.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:40.780
Is there anything wrong with a girl like that wanting to
destroy the Demon District, the place where she was born?

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.220
What do you think?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.540
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:50.540
Maybe those kids have a valid reason for being angry.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:56.980
Maybe Senga was right, and this island might
cause a large number of people to be sacrificed.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:02.580
But just as you guys want to destroy Itogami Island...

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:07.060
I, too, want to protect the people who live here!

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:12.380
So I'm going to stop all of you! Tartaros Lapus!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:16.120
From now on, this is my fight!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.840
I refuse to accept that kind of logic!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.160
No, Senpai.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:24.940
This is our fight!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.400
W-We're here too, okay? For what it's worth.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.240
Da!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.560
It's over,December!

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:34.840
Not yet, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.020
Appear swiftly! Dabih-Crystallus!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:47.300
One of the Fourth Primogenitor's familiars, huh?

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:50.680
I was right after all.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.540
We should have realized earlier.

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:59.140
December... was the tenth month of the ancient Roman calender.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.980
The Tenth Kaleid Blood...

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.760
You're a seal for the Fourth Primogenitor's power,
just like Avrora was. Right, December!?

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.700
Don't tell me... Did you remember, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:12.980
Yeah.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.120
The Scorched Banquet that happened nine months ago.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.420
And Avrora... I remember her too.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.900
You... weren't involved in that, right?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:29.060
I was the Third Primogenitor's captive back then.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.220
The Third...

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.120
You mean Chaos Bride!?

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.760
It seems she's very interested in you as well.

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:41.100
I was only released because I told her that I wanted to go to Itogami Island.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.060
You... Your body...!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:50.440
We, the Numbered, are literally the Fourth Primogenitor's seals.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.620
Once the seal is undone, we have no option but to disappear.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:20:00.800
The Tenth Familiar that was sealed within me, which is basically my own self.

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:05.900
Dabih-Crystallus is a being that governs over the vampiric ability to charm.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:08.780
So we can even do things like this!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:16.420
Even if the Rose falls, the Four Heavenly Beasts that were summoned will remain!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:21.320
The power to destroy Itogami Island, which was summoned by my friends!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.820
Dammit, come out! Natra-Cinereus!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:34.380
Rozenkavalier Plus!

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.420
Come out, Al-Nasl-Minium!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.360
Al-Meissa-Mercury!

00:20:54.360 --> 00:21:00.780
I, Akatsuki Kojou, successor to the blood of "Kaleid Blood",
now release your constraints.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.860
I, Sword Shaman of the High God and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:15.800
Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy mist, grant me the divine might of thy steel,

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:18.720
that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.840
Come out, Fifth Familiar.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.860
Regulus-Aurum!

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.820
It's your win, Kojou.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:47.820
December!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.640
I have one last request.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:58.140
Take Ran... Carly, and Rogi to a proper research facility.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.440
The way they are now, they won't live for much longer.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.000
I understand.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:07.480
Thank you, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.960
I'll give you the power of the Tenth Familiar.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:14.260
Wait, December! I...!

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:17.440
Don't look so sad.

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:22.800
It's fine. I will always be at your side.

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:33.120
Protect the Twelfth, Avrora.

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:37.780
That child is your hope.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:24.580
So you disappeared, December.

00:24:26.220 --> 00:24:28.800
Worry not. I will take care of this island-

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:32.720
You want to destroy the keystone and cause the island to collapse?

00:24:33.540 --> 00:24:36.300
I won't let you do that, Senga Takehito.

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:40.260
Why the hell are you still alive, Yaze Akishige!?

00:24:43.060 --> 00:24:44.580
Hyper Adapter!?

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:49.000
Sealing off Itogami Island, throwing the Island Administration into chaos...

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:53.400
And now, the Priestess of Cain has entered the casket.

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:56.880
With this, all the preparations have been completed.

00:24:58.320 --> 00:25:01.860
You have done well, Tartaros Lapus.

00:25:03.860 --> 00:25:06.480
You were using us from the start...!?

00:25:08.640 --> 00:25:13.520
You're willing to go so far to slaughter the demons!?

00:25:13.940 --> 00:25:16.160
Descendants of the Sinful God....

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:23.940
This can't be real... Don't tell me...

00:25:24.860 --> 00:25:28.160
This is "C"? Cain's Coffin?

00:25:29.420 --> 00:25:33.660
Mogwai.... You are...!
